      "summary_en": "In human form, Nidalee lays a trap for unwary opponents that, when sprung, damages and reveals its target. As a cougar, she jumps in a direction, dealing damage in an area where she lands.",
      "summary_zh": "人类形态下， 奈德丽会对指定位置放置一个陷阱，踩中陷阱的单位的视野将会被暴露给奈德丽，并持续受到伤害。美洲狮形态下，她会猛扑向目标，落地时造成伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
